        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "SECTION 9.4.2.6. If the selected job is one not previously held by that employee, he/she must possess sufficient qualifications of skill, aptitude, experience, dexterity, and knowledge, in accordance with Company qualifications in effect at the time for the selected job.",
