        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "SECTION 9.4.2.7. So as to avoid situations of an employee of limited experience in his/her title classification from bumping a more seasoned employee in that same classification, the employee can exercise his/her full accredited service only if he/she has two or more years' work time spent in that job. If he/she elects to seek a job of lower classification previously held by him, his/her time in both jobs shall be additive for purposes of this provision.",
            "block_bbox": [
